<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        .container {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 40px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .header h2 {
            color: #d9534f;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .content {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333333;
        }
        .alert-badge {
            background-color: #d9534f;
            color: white;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            display: inline-block;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .info-box {
            background-color: #f4f7f6;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .info-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 8px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }
        .info-row:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .info-label {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #666;
        }
        .info-value {
            color: #333;
        }
        .highlight {
            background-color: #fff3cd;
            padding: 15px;
            border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .button-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .button {
            background-color: #3266CC;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #999999;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <img src="{{logoUrl}}" alt="Abittoenergy Logo" style="max-width: 200px; height: auto;" />
        </div>
        <div class="header">
            <h2>Gas Balance Exhausted! ⚠️</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello {{firstName}},</p>
            
            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <span class="alert-badge">! Action Required</span>
            </div>
            
            <p>We are writing to inform you that the gas balance for your meter has been exhausted. As a result, the valve on your meter has been automatically closed to prevent any further usage until a refill is made.</p>
            
            <div class="info-box">
                <p><strong>Meter Information:</strong></p>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Meter Number:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{meterNumber}}</span>
                </div>
                {{#if estateName}}
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Location:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{estateName}}{{#if houseNumber}}, House {{houseNumber}}{{/if}}</span>
                </div>
                {{/if}}
            </div>

            <div class="highlight">
                <p><strong>What should you do?</strong></p>
                <p>To resume gas flow, please purchase additional gas units via your dashboard. Once the purchase is confirmed, the valve will be reopened according to your new balance.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="button-container">
                <a href="{{buyGasUrl}}" class="button" style="color:#ffffff; background-color: #669900;">Buy Gas Now</a>
            </div>
            
            <p>You can monitor your real-time usage and manage all your meters by logging into your Abittoenergy dashboard.</p>
            
            <p>Thank you for choosing Abittoenergy!</p>
            
            <p>Best regards,<br>The Abittoenergy Team</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; 2026 Abittoenergy. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
